# Python File Organization

All Python files must be placed in the `src` folder.

## Requirements
- Place all `.py` files in the `src/` directory
- Organize modules logically within `src/` using subdirectories as needed
- Keep the root directory clean of Python source files

## Application
- Apply this rule when creating new Python files
- Apply this rule when organizing or refactoring existing Python files
